{"step_index":1021,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:25:19Z","thinking":"Subagents are concurrently gathering information from multiple search sources. Analysis focuses on integrating 39 newly vetted companies, strictly verified for Busan address and matching CEO/contact details, with the existing validated company database. This merge results in a total of 189 verified companies.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst v = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2/scratch/strictly_verified_pass1.json', 'utf8'));\n\nlet yearCount = 0, telCount = 0, faxCount = 0, empCount = 0, closeCount = 0;\nfor (const x of v) {\n  if (x.estDate) yearCount++;\n  if (x.foundPhone) telCount++;\n  if (x.foundFax) faxCount++;\n  if (x.emp) empCount++;\n  if (x.closeDate) closeCount++;\n}\nconsole.log('Total 39 companies details:');\nconsole.log('estDate count:', yearCount);\nconsole.log('tel count:', telCount);\nconsole.log('fax count:', faxCount);\nconsole.log('emp count:', empCount);\nconsole.log('closeDate count:', closeCount);\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\fill_missing_business_numbers","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Checking fields in 39 companies","toolSummary":"Check fields in 39 companies"}}]}
